The Voyager Golden Record and its contents are not covered. NASA-produced
material is generally public domain; a significant portion of the 116
photographs on the record are third-party works licensed for use on the record
itself. The 384 kHz digitisation of the master tapes is hosted by the Internet
Archive courtesy of Ron Barry and David Pescovitz.

Ron Barry's original decoder, from which pipeline/barry_tables.json is derived,
is at https://github.com/foodini/voyager
